# Squash solo - Focus: Drops, Lobs & Length
@description Solo practice for one court, about 50 minutes, on the front of the court and the back:
  length by height, drops and lobs, boasts, and length when tired, between rounds of ghosting to
  reach the front early.
@speech rate 1.1
@minimum gap 0:00.8
@workout squash
@artwork ../images/squash.jpg
@include ../shared/squash.overtone

## Intro
Focus session: drops, lobs and length. Start early to reach the drop, lob to buy time, and aim
higher for length.

## Movement warm-up (4 min)
[movement warm-up]

## Figure of eight warm-up (3 min)
[figure of eight]

## Ghosting: split step and go (3 min)
Ghosting, split step and go, three minutes. Slow pace, front corners. Reaching drops is about
starting early, not running faster. Split step as each call starts, push off hard, and lunge closed
with the racket already up. Swing on the beep, and get back to the T for the next call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [slow front]
0:50 Rest. Wait just behind the T, not deep.
-0:03 [countdown]
1:05 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [slow front]
1:54 Rest. Racket up before you arrive. Stay low in the lunge.
-0:03 [countdown]
2:09 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [slow front]
---
[stop]

## Forehand length by height (3 min)
Forehand length by height, three minutes. Behind the short line, a racket length off the side wall.
Straight drives at medium pace, aimed about a racket head above the service line. Height gives you
length without forcing it: first bounce behind the service box, second bounce near the back wall.
When a good one dies in the back, play the next one higher and softer to get the rally back.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Aim higher, not harder.
1:00 Racket up early. Step in and stomp.
1:45 Hit it level with your front foot. Weight goes forward.
2:20 Finish high, to the front wall. Keep the grip relaxed.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Backhand length by height (3 min)
Backhand length by height, three minutes. Behind the short line, a racket length off the side wall.
Straight drives at medium pace, aimed about a racket head above the service line. Height gives you
length without forcing it: first bounce behind the service box, second bounce near the back wall.
When a good one dies in the back, play the next one higher and softer to get the rally back.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Aim higher, not harder.
1:00 Racket away from your body. Rotate.
1:45 Hit it level with your front foot. Weight goes forward.
2:20 Finish high, to the front wall. Keep the grip relaxed.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Forehand drop and lob (3 min)
Forehand drop and lob, three minutes. On the short line near the side wall, play a soft drop, then
move in and lob it before its second bounce. Get low and under the ball, open the face, and lift it
high above the service line so it lands in the back corner. Collect it and repeat. Straight for the
first half, then cross-court.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Get under the ball. Low to high.
0:55 Open face. Lift it, don't hit it.
1:30 Now cross-court. Aim high, on your half of the front wall.
2:10 Clip the side wall high, behind the service box.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Backhand drop and lob (3 min)
Backhand drop and lob, three minutes. On the short line near the side wall, play a soft drop, then
move in and lob it before its second bounce. Get low and under the ball, open the face, and lift it
high above the service line so it lands in the back corner. Collect it and repeat. Straight for the
first half, then cross-court.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Get under the ball. Low to high.
0:55 Open face. Lift it, don't hit it.
1:30 Now cross-court. Aim high, on your half of the front wall.
2:10 Clip the side wall high, behind the service box.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Ghosting: front corners with lobs (3 min)
Ghosting, front corners with lobs, three minutes. Medium pace. Lunge closed and play a shadow lob on
the beep, face open, swinging low to high and finishing high. Then get back to the T for the next
call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium front]
0:47 Rest. Get lower than the ball. Lift through it.
-0:03 [countdown]
1:02 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium front]
1:48 Rest. Push back hard from the lunge.
-0:03 [countdown]
2:03 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium front]
---
[stop]

## Boast and straight lob (3 min)
Boast and straight lob, three minutes. Start in the back right corner. Boast to the front left, run
in, and lob straight down the left wall. Then boast from the back left to the front right, and lob
straight down the right wall, so every loop plays both boasts and both lobs. For the first half the
lob is the real shot, high and tight so it dies in the back corner, and the boast is a feed, softer
and higher so it sits up at the front. A lob too good to boast is a win: hand feed and restart.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Racket up as you run. Lob from low to high.
0:50 Lob high and tight to the wall. The height is your time to recover.
1:30 Swap. The boast is the real shot now, hard and low. The lob is a feed that sits up off the back wall.
2:10 Boast angled at the far front corner. Hand feed whenever it breaks.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Ghosting: back to front (3 min)
Ghosting, back to front, three minutes. Medium pace, back and front corners. This is the rally that
beats you: pushed deep, then a drop. Get fully back to the T after every back corner, so the front
is in reach. Swing on the beep, and get back to the T for the next call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, no repeats} [medium back], [medium front]
0:47 Rest. Don't hang deep. Back to the T every time.
-0:03 [countdown]
1:02 @random{fill, no repeats} [medium back], [medium front]
1:48 Rest. Split step, then attack the front.
-0:03 [countdown]
2:03 @random{fill, no repeats} [medium back], [medium front]
---
[stop]

## Boast and cross-court (3 min)
Boast and cross-court, three minutes. Start in the back right corner. Boast so the ball reaches the
front left, run after it, and drive it firmly cross-court, just above the service line on the left
half of the front wall, into the back right corner. Then boast again and keep the loop going. The
boast is a feed, soft enough to reach; the cross-court is the shot. Switch sides halfway. Restart
with a hand feed whenever it breaks down.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Width: hit the side wall behind the service box.
0:50 Get in front of the ball. Rotate through it.
1:30 Switch. Boast from the back left, cross-court from the front right, aiming right of centre.
2:10 Wide enough to pass someone standing on the T.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Forehand length when tired (2 min)
Forehand length when tired, two minutes. Behind the short line, straight drives aimed a racket head
above the service line, as earlier. Tired is when length drops short in a match, so hold the same
shot. Score each set of ten by how many bounce first behind the short line, resetting with a softer
one whenever you need to.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:20 Aim higher, not harder.
1:10 Racket up early. Count them.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Backhand length when tired (2 min)
Backhand length when tired, two minutes. Behind the short line, straight drives aimed a racket head
above the service line, as earlier. Tired is when length drops short in a match, so hold the same
shot. Score each set of ten by how many bounce first behind the short line, resetting with a softer
one whenever you need to.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:20 Aim higher, not harder.
1:10 Racket up early. Count them.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Ghosting: drop retrieval (3 min)
Ghosting, drop retrieval, three minutes. Fast pace, all six positions, with the front corners called
twice as often. Split step on every call, swing on the beep, and sprint back to the T for the next
call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast front], [fast all]
0:33 Rest. Split step as the call starts. Push off early.
-0:03 [countdown]
0:48 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast front], [fast all]
1:20 Rest. Racket up before you arrive.
-0:03 [countdown]
1:35 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast front], [fast all]
2:07 Rest. Last round. Stay engaged.
-0:03 [countdown]
2:22 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast front], [fast all]
---
[stop]

